"A message displayed when requesting access to the user's \"Desktop\" folder "
"(in English)."
msgstr "請求存取使用者的“桌面”資料夾時顯示的（英文）消息。"

msgid ""
"A message displayed when requesting access to the user's \"Desktop\" folder "
"(localized)."
msgstr "請求存取使用者的“桌面”資料夾時顯示的（當地語系化）消息。"

